
>> countries := تىزىم يېڭى
	~ ⌝'Switzerland'⌜
	~ ⌝'Italy'⌜
	~ ⌝'Germany'⌜.

>> foods := تىزىم يېڭى
	~ ⌝'Rösti'⌜
	~ ⌝'Spaghetti'⌜
	~ ⌝'Sauerkraut'⌜.


>> counter := 0.
foods بويىچە: countries, ھەربىر: ⎬ :key :value
	counter قوش: 1.
⎨.

چىقىرىش ياز: ﴿⌝'we serve counter dishes'⌜ counter: counter﴾, يېڭى-قۇر.

>> counter := 42.
⌝'TrytosortthiswithoutsegfaultingButActualNumberDe✎dsOnOS'⌜ ھەرپلەر تەرتىپلە: ⎬ :v
	counter قوش: 0.
⎨.

چىقىرىش ياز: ﴿⌝'we sort counter dishes'⌜ counter: counter﴾, يېڭى-قۇر.


>> counter := 0.
⎬
	⎬
		counter قوش: 1.
	⎨ × ﴿3 + 1 + 1 × 0.5﴾.
⎨ × 100.


چىقىرىش ياز: ﴿⌝'we calculate counter numbers.'⌜ counter: counter﴾, يېڭى-قۇر.

